{"hw":"μοχθηρία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μοχθηρία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μοχθ-ηρία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">bad condition</b>, <span class=\"gk\">σκήνεος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Democr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">187</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σώματος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">609e</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> of a person, <b class=\"lex-tr\">lack of skill, incapacity</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ ἰατροῦ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.2.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῶν κυβερνητῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">302a</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> mostly in moral sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">wickedness, depravity</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">109</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">159</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">734d</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τὰς μ. τῆς ἠλιθιότητος τῆς ἐμῆς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cratin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">188</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀρεταὶ καὶ μοχθηρίαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1129b24</span> </span>: with a political connotation, <span class=\"gk\">τὰ πρῶτα τῆς ἐκεῖ μ.</span> chief <b class=\"lex-tr\">of the rascaldom</b> (i.e. of the Radical party) up there (on earth), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">425</span> </span>.</div></div>"}